WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.410 --> 00:00:04.799
There are many reasons why the world loves
Jason Momoa: He stole and broke hearts on

00:00:04.799 --> 00:00:08.960
Game of Thrones, he made a splash as Aquaman
in Justice League and will do it again in

00:00:08.960 --> 00:00:14.180
his own standalone movie this year, and his
tattoos and hair inspire serious style envy.

00:00:14.180 --> 00:00:18.260
But we have another item to add to the list:
Momoa recently took a photo with two fans

00:00:18.260 --> 00:00:20.570
that the world can't stop laughing about.

00:00:20.570 --> 00:00:26.340
Liz Medendorp, who goes by the username twoforjoy
on Imgur, attended Denver Comic Con back in

00:00:26.340 --> 00:00:29.609
June, where she had the chance to take a picture
with the Game of Thrones alum.

00:00:29.609 --> 00:00:30.609
She explained on Imgur,

00:00:30.609 --> 00:00:34.840
"I told my husband I wanted a picture alone
with Jason Momoa, but he wasn't comfortable

00:00:34.840 --> 00:00:35.840
with that."

00:00:35.840 --> 00:00:39.770
So her husband, Anthony Mendendorp, hopped
into frame, but Momoa ending up getting the

00:00:39.770 --> 00:00:44.780
last word when he used one arm to pose with
Liz and the other to push her husband away.

00:00:44.780 --> 00:00:49.079
Momoa later added a cherry on top of the priceless
picture by signing his autograph directly

00:00:49.079 --> 00:00:50.570
over Anthony's face.

00:00:50.570 --> 00:00:51.570
Liz shared,

00:00:51.570 --> 00:00:52.969
"[Momoa] was all about it.

00:00:52.969 --> 00:00:56.760
When he saw the print-out to sign it, he said,
'This is f---ing amazing.'"

00:00:56.760 --> 00:01:00.660
Liz later revealed to Bored Panda that her
husband's discomfort actually stemmed from

00:01:00.660 --> 00:01:05.050
not wanting to spend so much money on a photo
if he wasn't going to be in it, and that Momoa

00:01:05.050 --> 00:01:07.840
was totally on board with the joke when the
couple pitched it to him.

00:01:07.840 --> 00:01:08.840
She continued,

00:01:08.840 --> 00:01:09.840
"'Hell yeah!'

00:01:09.840 --> 00:01:10.990
was Momoa's immediate response.

00:01:10.990 --> 00:01:15.070
Before I knew it, the camera flashed, and
everyone in the booth around us was laughing.

00:01:15.070 --> 00:01:19.470
As we were shuffled toward the exit, I heard
Momoa call out, 'My man, that's going to be

00:01:19.470 --> 00:01:20.680
the best one!'"

00:01:20.680 --> 00:01:25.070
Over 3,000 comments on Reddit later, it's
safe to assume Anthony was more than happy

00:01:25.070 --> 00:01:27.850
to be shoved in the face by the mega-muscled
superstar.

00:01:27.850 --> 00:01:29.210
Thanks for watching!

00:01:29.210 --> 00:01:31.480
Click the Looper icon to subscribe to our
YouTube channel.

00:01:31.480 --> 00:01:34.250
Plus check out all this cool stuff we know
you'll love, too!

